# compiled output — dist/ IS committed deliberately: this package is
# consumed as a git dependency (github:mahak-smile/smile-user-rbac#vX.Y.Z),
# not published to a registry, and npm's script-security defaults block
# the prepack/prepare build step on a git install (verified: dist/ never
# gets built otherwise). Rebuild and commit it as part of cutting any
# release tag.
